        "alt": "迷子案内所の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "peony.meet.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/peony-meet-paper-crown-v3.png",
        "alt": "折り紙の小さな王冠を作るピオニー"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "peony.meet.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "迷子のお迎え要請で、案内所へ走った。着くと、男の子は泣いていなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "代わりに、天井につっかえそうな巨大な人が、滝みたいな汗をかいていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "折り紙と、真剣に向き合っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "桃色の髪、立派な角、城壁みたいな肩幅。全神経を指先の一点に集めて、紙の冠を折っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "男の子は隣で、わくわくと完成を待っている。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "peony.meet.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "しー……。今、いちばん、むずかしいところ。……つのの、おりかえし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あとで知ったが、この拳は、風圧だけで城壁を砂にする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その手が、いま、五センチの折り返しに挑んでいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は、息を止めて見守った。案内所全体が、息を止めていた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——完成。紙の冠が、男の子の頭にそっと載る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "歓声。その瞬間、ピオニーが安心して、大きく息を吸って——くしゃみをした。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "shake"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "窓の外で、雲が割れた。掲示物が全部めくれ、耳が真後ろへなびいた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "館内放送「突風にご注意ください」——屋内で。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ごめんなさい。でも、かんむりは、まもった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見ると、彼女は両手で、男の子と冠を風から囲っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雲は割ったが、紙の冠は守った。優先順位が、完璧に彼女だった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "迷子係の方、ですか?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ううん。……わたしも、まいご。むかし守ってた城が、もう地図にないの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "守り方だけ、おぼえてるんだけど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "案内所に居着いた理由が、それだった。迷子は、迷子の面倒を見るのが上手い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "守る城を失くした巨人が、小さな窓口で、紙の冠を守っている。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "お母さんが迎えに来て、案内所が静かになる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ピオニーは、余った折り紙で二つ目の冠を折り始めた。さっきより、指が少しだけ緊張している。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……これは、うさみみが、じゃまにならない設計。……できたら、もらって、くれる?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "城壁を砂にする手が、私の耳の位置を測っている。冠の設計を、私仕様に変えている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "peony.meet.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "断る選択肢は、この世に存在しなかった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "peony.meet.choice.001",
          "label": "迷子が泣き止むまで隣に座る",
          "result": "その日の午後、また迷子が来た。今度は大泣きの女の子。ピオニーが「大きくて安心な壁」に、私が「話を聞く係」になった。泣き止んだ女の子は帰り際、角へ紙冠をお返しに載せた。その日一日、彼女の宝物だった。",
          "intent": "守る側の隣で、案内所の午後を手伝う",
          "promise": "目先の報酬は得ない代わりに、この人が何を失ったかを知る。",
          "memory": "角の先の紙冠の日を、ピオニーは何度も話す。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "peony"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 7,
              "ownership": -2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "peony.meet.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "peony.meet.choice.002",
          "label": "今日はピオニーを誘わず、用事へ戻る",
          "result": "仕事に戻る私の頭には、耳がじゃまにならない設計の紙冠。「かわいい」と言われるたび、作者の宣伝をした。翌週、案内所に「冠の折り方教室（こわれません）」の貼り紙——但し書きに、彼女の全力が詰まっている。",
          "intent": "今日は業務へ戻る",
          "promise": "所属選手にはならないが、後の出来事で再会できる。",
          "memory": "紙冠を一日かぶっていた店員のことを、ピオニーは覚えている。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "peony.meet.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "peony.meet.node.effect.001",
